        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kuk Harrell, Rihanna, Beyoncé, Diane Warren, Ryan Tedder, Brent Kutzle\n- Products: \"Only Girl (In the World)\", \"Umbrella\", \"I Was Here\", Loud\n- Topics: vocal production, songwriting, Grammy Awards, Billboard No. 1 singles\n\nFacts:\n- Rihanna recorded \"Only Girl (In the World)\" for her 2010 fifth album Loud.\n- Kuk Harrell earned his fourth Grammy for vocal production on Rihanna's Billboard No. 1 single \"Only Girl (In the World)\".\n- Kuk Harrell was the vocal producer and co-writer of Rihanna's Grammy-winning single \"Umbrella\".\n- Diane Warren wrote the song \"I Was Here\".\n- Ryan Tedder, Brent Kutzle, and Kuk Harrell produced \"I Was Here\".\n- Beyoncé received vocal production credit on \"I Was Here\".",
